日のきょんこ先生のお題は家庭教師ということで家庭教師っぽいスーツではないけどスーツみたいな私服を持ってきてみました♪😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生っぽいかな？😮"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHD5WYKWPE6TJ11QJM9CY9M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとポニーテールにしてみたよ！😊♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHD5XZHHWFVRRXWVJJV11KT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部はストレートで下ろしにしてみました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストレートは私にとってレアなので個握ではまたしますね😘"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もとっても楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の中会いにきてくださって本当にありがとうございました😵✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも感謝しています🍀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にスナック眞緒さんと🌹"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHD5Z1WEDYZ4ZX4EX54TY0H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラーメン大好き齊藤京子"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-n46-100837":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛知県出身　18歳の岡本姫奈です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の樋口さんの卒業セレモニー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場に足を運んでくださった方、配信で画面の向こう側から見てくださっていた方。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"樋口さんはいつも美しくて、目が釘付けになってしまいます。横を通りすぎるだけで緊張してしまうくらいでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５期生は「狼に口笛を」をご一緒に披露させていただいたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的に大好きなこの曲を憧れの方と踊らさせて頂けて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く幸せな気持ちと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しい気持ちでいっぱいでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、葉月さんにとある振り付けを教えていただいた！とお話しさせて頂いたお思うのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「狼に口笛を」の肩を動かす振り付けを細かく教えて頂きました！ありがとございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202211/mobMDDvhK.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の顔が泣きすぎてぐちゃぐちゃで……"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"樋口さんの言葉はどれも胸に響いて、これからもっともっと頑張ろう。と勇気を与えてくださいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当日、大好きなまあやさんとも！お会いでき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また泣いてしまいました（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私から「まあやさん！次はいつ会えますか！」なんて声をかけられるようになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202211/mobWfgQiq.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フォルダを見返したらめっちゃピンぼけしてて……🤣🤣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に加入してから、沢山の出会いがあり、沢山のお別れがありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ加入して一年も経っていない私たちですが、先輩方の優しさに触れるたびにお別れが悲しくて、胸がぎゅっとなります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感情が表に出やすいのを最近自覚し始めました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日、飛鳥さんが年内で乃木坂46をご卒業されるという発表がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥さんがいつか乃木坂46から居なくなってしまう事を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えていなかったというか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えたくなかった　というのが本音です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５期生として加入し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥さん、樋口さん、まあやさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の憧れの方と少しでも携われたことずっとずっと忘れません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br